    <item>
      <title>Civ VII Developer Video - July 2026 | Update 1.4.2 Drops Tomorrow</title>
      <link>https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1295660/view/674001285755701918</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1295660/view/674001285755701918</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 16:05:34 +0000</pubDate>
      <category>Civilization VII</category>
      <description>&lt;div class="bb_h3"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Update 1.4.2 goes live tomorrow! &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="bb_paragraph"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="bb_paragraph"&gt;Update 1.4.2 is dropping tomorrow, July 28 at 7AM PT / 10AM ET / 4PM CET. This update includes a handful of improvements and changes aimed at deepening your diplomatic strategies: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul class="bb_ul"&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class="bb_paragraph"&gt;Expanded Peace Deals (you can now trade Gold and Influence in addition to Settlements)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class="bb_paragraph"&gt;Improved Leader Relationship C</description>
    </item>
